.Dd $Mdocdate: November 23 2026 $
.Dt HPEC 4
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm hpec
.Nd HP laptop embedded controller
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Cd "hpec* at iic?"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
driver provides support for the embedded controller found on some HP laptops.
Currently only keyboard backlight control is supported.
.Pp
Backlight levels can be retrieved and modified with the
.Xr wsconsctl 8
variable
.Va keyboard.backlight .
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr iic 4 ,
.Xr intro 4 ,
.Xr wskbd 4 ,
.Xr wsconsctl 8
.Sh HISTORY
The
.Nm
driver first appeared in
.Ox 8.1 .
.Sh AUTHORS
.An -nosplit
The
.Nm
driver was written by
.An Marcus Glocker Aq Mt mglocker@openbsd.org .
